<%- include('head') %><%- include('header') %><link rel="stylesheet" href="/admin.css"><script src="/admin.js" defer></script><main id="main" class="page-container admin-page"><div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR PRIVATE WRITING ROOM</p><h1>STUDIO<span>写作空间</span></h1><p>把今天的想法，写成下一段记忆。</p></div><button id="logout" class="button outline" <%= !loggedIn?'hidden':'' %>>退出登录</button></div>
<section id="login-panel" <%= loggedIn?'hidden':'' %>><form id="login-form" class="login-card"><span class="micro">WELCOME BACK</span><h2>继续你的故事。</h2><p>使用管理员密码进入写作空间。</p><label for="password">管理员密码</label><input id="password" name="password" type="password" required autocomplete="current-password"><button class="button" type="submit">进入写作空间 ↗</button><p class="form-message" id="login-message" role="alert"></p></form></section>
<section id="studio" <%= !loggedIn?'hidden':'' %>><div class="studio-toolbar"><button id="new-post" class="button">＋ 新文章</button><label class="button outline file-button">导入 Markdown<input id="import-markdown" type="file" accept=".md,.markdown,text/markdown,text/plain"></label><a class="button outline" href="/api/admin/export">导出全部文章 ↓</a><span id="post-count"></span></div><p class="studio-hint">导入的文章会先进入编辑区，点击“保存草稿”或“发布文章”后才会保存。</p><p id="studio-message" class="form-message" role="status"></p><div class="studio-layout"><aside id="admin-post-list" aria-label="管理文章"></aside><form id="editor" hidden><div class="editor-top"><strong id="editor-label">新文章</strong><span id="save-state">尚未保存</span></div><label for="title">文章标题</label><input id="title" name="title" required maxlength="200"><div class="field-grid"><div><label for="slug">网址标识</label><input id="slug" name="slug" required pattern="[a-z0-9]+(-[a-z0-9]+)*" maxlength="100" placeholder="my-new-story"></div><div><label for="date">发布日期</label><input id="date" name="date" type="date" required></div><div><label for="category">分类</label><input id="category" name="category" list="categories" maxlength="40"><datalist id="categories"><option>Agent 工程</option><option>调试笔记</option><option>沙箱与工具</option><option>随笔</option><option>生活</option></datalist></div><div><label for="tags">标签（用逗号分隔）</label><input id="tags" name="tags" placeholder="Python, Agent"></div><div><label for="series">系列（可选）</label><input id="series" name="series" maxlength="80"></div><div><label for="day">系列顺序</label><input id="day" name="day" type="number" min="0" max="9999" value="0"></div></div><label for="excerpt">文章摘要</label><textarea id="excerpt" name="excerpt" rows="3" maxlength="500"></textarea><div class="markdown-toolbar"><label for="markdown">Markdown 正文</label><div><label class="file-button">上传图片<input id="upload-image" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp,image/gif,image/avif"></label><button type="button" id="preview-button">预览 ↗</button></div></div><textarea id="markdown" name="markdown" rows="23" required spellcheck="false"></textarea><div id="markdown-preview" class="prose" hidden></div><p id="editor-message" class="form-message" role="status"></p><div class="editor-actions"><button type="submit" name="action" value="draft" class="button outline">保存草稿</button><button type="submit" name="action" value="published" class="button">发布文章 ↗</button><a id="view-post" target="_blank" rel="noopener" hidden>查看文章 ↗</a></div><p class="studio-hint">已发布文章保存为草稿后会从公开页面撤下。更改只在点击保存后生效。</p></form><div id="editor-empty" class="empty-state"><span>A BLANK PAGE, A NEW POSSIBILITY.</span><h2>下一段故事，从这里开始。</h2><p>选择已有文章，或新建一篇记录。</p></div></div></section></main><%- include('footer') %>
